% --- the triangulation this repository's implementation uses ------------------
% The 2025 paper triangulates the polyhedral cells on which a *trained network*
% is already affine, so its interpolation is exact by construction. Running the
% map the other way (FIS -> network) has no such canonical triangulation,
% because a TRIBBLE FIS is not piecewise linear; `experiments/fis-to-neural-net`
% imposes a regular Freudenthal/Kuhn lattice instead. These are the sources for
% that construction.

